  "2026-11-16T10:47:16.718Z",codex-sol,"Run 43707037608 failed the pm-github 2026.11.4 gate with two shared provenance tags. The #43 group separates sentinel migration from privacy-oracle repair; the #65 group separates durable-close recovery from coverage-memory repair. Preserve these distinct items. Main already includes PR #78 pinning both callers to 2026.11.15. The current pinned gated dry-run passes: 6 planned, 0 skipped, 2 matched, 0 adopted, 4 new. No duplicate closure or second caller-pin PR is justified."
  "2026-11-16T11:01:53.667Z",codex-sol,"Initial review receipt: the failed workflow log and current pin are documented in docs/issue-sync-2026-11-16.md. Seeded tracker validation passes through pm test --run --progress. Typecheck and lint pass. The quick package suite remains running under shared-host load; no complete passing suite is claimed.   Publish review evidence with pending gates explicit; no scheduled success is claimed."
